      has a `brain` entry, but the entry's `command` or `args` differ
      from the parsed/interpolated `mcpServerConfig`. Drift is detected
      by structural comparison: string equality on `command`,
      element-by-element equality on `args` (same length, same value
      at every position). Any deviation is drift; matching values are
      not."
